     "m": null,
     "props": {
      "html": "<h2>Here’s what we’re about</h2><p>We are real people on real journeys through life.</p><p>We don’t do judgement. Everyone is always welcome here.</p><p>We are about meeting you where you are now, so we can all walk together in the future.</p><p>We are about worshipping together, providing refuge from life’s challenges, and uplifting our communities through outreach.</p><p>We are about knowing the love of God in our lives and trying to pass that on to one another.  As long as we try, we can all make the world a better place!</p>"
     },
