       {
        "image": "/media/untitled-design-5.jpg",
        "title": "Children’s Ministry",
        "html": "<p>It is our privilege to share the love of Jesus with our children in safe, loving, meaningful, and fun ways. To that end, we screen and background check all of our teachers and volunteers.</p>",
        "label": "Learn More",
        "href": "/childrens-ministry"
       },
       {
        "image": "/media/img-7411-2.jpg",
        "title": "Youth Ministry",
        "html": "<p>Youth are not only the future of our church, but a vital part of our body of faith now.  We work hard to provide a safe place for youth (4th-12th grades) to explore who they are as Christians and develop their own relationship with God.</p>",
        "label": "Learn More",
        "href": "/youth-ministry"
       },
       {
        "image": "/media/img-7080.jpg",
        "title": "Adult Ministry",
        "html": "<p>Our faith journey doesn’t end when we reach adulthood! We offer many ministries for men, women, seniors, and more to grow in their discipleship.</p>",
        "label": "Learn More",
        "href": "/adult-ministry"
       }
      ]
     },
     "style": {}
    }
   ]
