     "m": null,
     "props": {
      "html": "<h2>About The UCC</h2><h3>A Church where all may be one.</h3><p>The United Church of Christ (UCC) is a distinct and diverse community of Christians that come together as one church to join faith and action.  With over 5,000 churches and nearly one million members across the United States, the UCC serves God in the co-creation of a just and sustainable world.</p><p>Since 1957, the United Church of Christ has been the church of firsts, weaving God’s message of hope and extravagant welcome with action for justice and peace. Together, we live out our faith in ways that bring change to our communities.</p>"
     },
